<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>take a chance</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">WIMY</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">take a chance</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6wXMCzkPo2tdrlKCBtB39d</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.298" end="00:17.732">Feel like it's already been</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.732" end="00:20.590">All this time and so long since</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.590" end="00:24.390">I met you, but I get to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.390" end="00:28.863">Fall in love again and again, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.863" end="00:30.798">So you're mine-mine-mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.798" end="00:34.138">Before you say goodbye-bye-bye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.138" end="00:37.419">So tell me we're alright-right-right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.419" end="00:41.458">So can I see you for tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.458" end="00:42.958">Take my hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.497" end="00:44.230">I'll hold it forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.230" end="00:45.750">Won't you take a chance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.750" end="00:47.430">So we'd be together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.430" end="00:50.702">You know that we've been through it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.702" end="00:53.910">So I know these aren't foolish thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.910" end="00:55.760">Take my hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.760" end="00:57.457">I'll hold it forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.457" end="00:59.089">Won't you take a chance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.089" end="01:00.863">So we'd be together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.863" end="01:04.034">You know that we've been through it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.034" end="01:08.241">So I know these aren't foolish thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.241" end="01:12.711">Am I crazy to believe that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.711" end="01:15.911">One day you could be there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.911" end="01:22.089">Looking for a glimpse of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.089" end="01:24.495">So you're mine-mine-mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.495" end="01:27.694">Before you say goodbye-bye-bye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.694" end="01:31.080">So tell me we're alright-right-right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.080" end="01:34.429">So can I see you for tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.429" end="01:35.985">Take my hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.985" end="01:37.806">I'll hold it forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.806" end="01:39.306">Won't you take a chance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.268" end="01:41.107">So we'd be together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.107" end="01:44.258">You know that we've been through it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.258" end="01:47.712">So I know these aren't foolish thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.712" end="01:49.445">Take my hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.445" end="01:51.202">I'll hold it forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.202" end="01:52.786">Won't you take a chance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.786" end="01:54.608">So we'd be together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.608" end="01:57.759">You know that we've been through it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.759" end="02:01.759">So I know these aren't foolish thoughts</p></div></body></tt>